VALUES (11155, 'tt0367623', NULL, 'Christmas Vacation 2: Cousin Eddie''s Island Adventure', 'Christmas Vacation 2: Cousin Eddie''s Island Adventure', 'movie', 2003, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTtEMlMul5Xpg4L2lOrj6Kp0R4I.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6ZA6O0q48rEpvqnm5SA5a5Cu4IC.jpg', 'Though Eddie''s fired right at Christmastime, his boss sends him and his family on a South Pacific vacation, hoping Eddie won''t sue him after being bitten by a lab monkey. When the Tuttle family winds up trapped on a tropical island, however, Eddie manages to provide for everyone and prove himself a real man.', NULL, NULL, 2.7377, 4.005, 0, 1.02, '2026-11-27 20:26:40', '2026-11-27 20:26:40')
