VALUES (253372, 'tt10946316', NULL, 'The Institute', 'The Institute', 'tv', 2025, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MwXkOAMd9ObxdacasPFM32n9dZ.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wWleS7DxsoGCkOPisNf8OZ2udiD.jpg', 'When 14 year old genius Luke Ellis is kidnapped, he awakens at The Institute, a facility full of children who all got there the same way he did, and who are all possessed of unusual abilities. In a nearby town, haunted former police officer Tim Jamieson has come looking to start a new life, but the peace and quiet won’t last, as his story and Luke’s are destined to collide.', NULL, NULL, 27.2494, 7.513, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-27 20:26:40', '2026-11-27 20:26:40')
