VALUES (26910, 'tt0367495', NULL, 'Anbe Sivam', 'அன்பே சிவம்', 'movie', 2003, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6T5bfP1OQMLyoW5Bxgr2Z8z0Y8b.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9QaebfA43SkffIy6sDFje5q0jdk.jpg', 'Anbarasu, an arrogant advertisement director, and Nallasivam, a physically deformed social activist, meet while waiting for a flight in Bhubaneswar. Both men are desperate to reach Chennai: the former has to attend his upcoming wedding, and the latter has to deliver a ₹32 lakh compensation to a group of union workers. Heavy rainfall causes total flight cancellations and floods the city, leaving Anbarasu with no choice but to share a hotel room with Sivam for the night, and soon, the pair find themselves embarking on a journey to Chennai together.', NULL, NULL, 1.3554, 7.7, 0, 10.01, '2026-11-27 20:26:40', '2026-11-27 20:26:40')
