VALUES (9792, 'tt0454841', NULL, 'The Hills Have Eyes', 'The Hills Have Eyes', 'movie', 2006, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2eJL1Ccr1FN3dm9OSDwyd8uaX1b.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vrFI0I3M8ROZduj9XbFDoQKZyao.jpg', 'Based on Wes Craven''s 1977 suspenseful cult classic, The Hills Have Eyes is the story of a family road trip that goes terrifyingly awry when the travelers become stranded in a government atomic zone. Miles from nowhere, the Carter family soon realizes the seemingly uninhabited wasteland is actually the breeding ground of a blood-thirsty mutant family...and they are the prey.', NULL, NULL, 7.1884, 6.5, 0, 1.80190909090909094e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-11-27 20:26:40')
