VALUES (2789, 'tt0296572', NULL, 'The Chronicles of Riddick', 'The Chronicles of Riddick', 'movie', 2004, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVO1r90diKfFLzvZ5D3qK6Z558O.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lt3NqorBMWn786m9bzqM0OLdMS8.jpg', 'After years of outrunning ruthless bounty hunters, escaped convict Riddick suddenly finds himself caught between opposing forces in a fight for the future of the human race. Now, waging incredible battles on fantastic and deadly worlds, this lone, reluctant hero will emerge as humanity''s champion - and the last hope for a universe on the edge of annihilation.', NULL, NULL, 3.6839, 6.566, 0, 3.23210714285714288e+01, '2026-07-21 03:32:24', '2026-11-27 20:26:40')
