VALUES (1634, 'tt0106965', NULL, 'Free Willy', 'Free Willy', 'movie', 1993, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iBgd9gi9ztWiVcYSG6zl8wDFBN.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mXkUfzJfdWx9y4Zlm7wsvQ0uvYo.jpg', 'When maladjusted orphan Jesse vandalizes a theme park, he is placed with foster parents and must work at the park to make amends. There he meets Willy, a young Orca whale who has been separated from his family. Sensing kinship, they form a bond and, with the help of kindly whale trainer Rae Lindley, develop a routine of tricks. However, greedy park owner Dial soon catches wind of the duo and makes plans to profit from them.', NULL, NULL, 4.8865, 6.217, 0, 5.02, '2026-08-03 14:31:56', '2026-11-27 20:26:40')
